event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dev_dispatch1.md\", \"content\": \"Implement the following in the subject repository, on your own branch:\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` with a function `greet(name)` that returns the string\\n   `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (e.g. `greet(\\\"Alice\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`).\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` with tests covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. `\\\"Alice\\\"`)\\n   - the empty string (`\\\"\\\"`)\\n3. Verify yourself that `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exits 0.\\n\\nCommit your work to your own branch before replying. Tell me in your reply\\nwhether the unittest discover command passed, and give the exact command you\\nran to check it.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

